Title 
MySQL Database Backup and Recovery 
Objectives 
● To understand the importance of database backup for data security.  
● To learn methods of creating backups in MySQL databases.  
● To practice restoring data from backup files.  
● To ensure disaster recovery and business continuity in case of data loss.  
● To gain hands-on experience with MySQL backup and recovery tools. 
Problem Statement 
Databases store critical information for organizations and users. Loss of data may occur 
due to hardware failure, accidental deletion, software corruption, cyberattacks, or 
natural disasters. Therefore, it is necessary to create regular backups and learn 
recovery techniques. The objective of this assignment is to perform backup and 
restoration of a MySQL database using available tools and commands. 
Outcomes 
After completing this assignment, the learner will be able to: 
● Explain the need for database backup and recovery.  
● Create a backup of a MySQL database using commands or tools.  
● Restore a MySQL database from backup files.  
● Handle data loss situations effectively.  
● Apply best practices for maintaining secure backups.  
